# Line-ending policy for the antenna/patch subtree.
# The repo root has core.autocrlf=true; without this, Git warns
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" every time it touches a text file on Windows.
# Force LF in the working tree so checkout/commit never rewrites line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes / line endings.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.h5   binary
*.vtk  binary
*.xml  binary
